      "id": "housingko-viewing-1",
      "kind": "plain",
      "text": "一棟のマンションで、玄関と台所のある独立した住居を一{}見学しました。",
      "en": "Inside one apartment building, I viewed one independent home with its own entrance and kitchen.",
      "noun": "マンション内の独立した住居",
      "phrase": "一戸",
      "reading": "いっこ",
      "readingAnswers": [
        "いっこ"
      ],
      "good": [
        "戸",
        "一戸",
        "軒",
        "一軒",
        "つ",
        "一つ",
        "個",
        "一個",
        "室",
        "一室",
        "部屋",
        "一部屋"
      ],
      "kana": [
        "いっこ",
        "こ",
        "けん",
        "いっけん",
        "ひとつ",
        "しつ",
        "いっしつ",
        "へや",
        "ひとへや"
      ],
      "distractors": [
        "棟",
        "冊",
        "匹"
      ],
      "note": "戸 counts a separate dwelling unit, not the whole apartment building. 軒 and generic counts can also refer to homes. 室/部屋 may conversationally refer to the apartment as a unit, so they are accepted without pretending every home consists of only one interior room."
    },
